## Input

```css
@supports ($property: grid) {
  .scss-variable {
    display: grid;
  }
}

.after-variable {
  display: block;
}

@supports (#{$condition}) {
  .scss-interpolation {
    display: grid;
  }
}

.after-interpolation {
  display: block;
}

@supports (#{$property}: grid) {
  .scss-interpolated-name {
    display: grid;
  }
}

.after-interpolated-name {
  display: block;
}

